		{
			"id":"9e4485f124bc23a1",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- Respiratory\n- Cardiovascular\n- Gastrointestinal + Genitourinary\n- GALS (If the patient has ANY suspicion of knee involvement, you MUST include knee...you will be marked down if you miss this)\n- GALS + Knee\n- Neurological Part 1 – Cranial Nerves\n- Neurological Part 2 – Upper Limbs\n- Neurological Part 3 – Lower Limbs\n- EENT (remove BPPV)\n- EENT (remove Eyes & BPPV)\n- Neurological Part 1 – Cranial Nerves + BPPV\n- Ears + BPPV",
